summary:
  main.qml resumes the buffer without handing the engine a clock.

history:
  The engine measures how far the reader would be from the writer by the
  caller's clock, like every other gesture. Given none it has only the park
  to go by and opens there, which is the short pause's four reopens again.

target:
  package/contents/ui/main.qml

find:
          if (!timeshift.resumeGesture(Date.now())) {

replace:
          if (!timeshift.resumeGesture()) {

expect:
  Killed by test_invariants::test_a_resume_of_the_single_file_is_given_the_clock.
  Line-neutral.
